The headers in include/ffnvcodec come from FFmpeg's nv-codec-headers, tag n12.0.16.1, and are
compile-time only: FFmpeg builds against them and loads the NVIDIA driver's libraries at run time.
Each file carries its own license, which applies to that file only, and they are reproduced here
as they stand at the head of each file.

